---
import FarmLayout from '../../layouts/FarmLayout.astro';

// Free Sample Policy — Modern Transparency Guide
---

<FarmLayout
  title="Free Sample Policy | Farm Direct"
  description="Guidelines regarding free agricultural produce sample distribution in Gwalior neighbourhoods including Pawan Nagar and Chetakpuri."
  canonicalPath="/farm/sample-policy"
>
  <div class="fd-container py-8 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
      <!-- Title Card -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-900 font-extrabold bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full">
          <span>🎁</span>
          <span>Quality Transparency</span>
        </span>
        <h1 class="fd-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#122815] leading-tight">
          Free Sample Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5b6e5d] leading-relaxed">
          How our free 100g and 200g tasting program works for Pawan Nagar and Chetakpuri households in Gwalior.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Principle Box -->
      <div class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#edf5ec] border border-[#d6e5d3] text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#1b4522] font-semibold leading-relaxed">
          🌾 <strong>Our Commitment:</strong> The purpose of our free sample tasting program is to allow Gwalior families to inspect, boil, or taste our raw unpolished produce before ordering 5kg, 10kg, or 25kg seasonal bags.
        </div>

        <!-- Policy Rules Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2 text-xs text-[#526454]">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#122815] block">Eligible Produce Varieties</strong>
            <p>Free samples are available for raw wheat, whole groundnut, desi chana, moong, urad, and seasonal specialties based on current farm stock.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#122815] block">Standardized Pouch Sizes</strong>
            <p>Samples are strictly packaged in <strong>100 grams</strong> or <strong>200 grams</strong> pouches. Commercial or bulk free quantities are not supported.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#122815] block">Consolidated Batch Rounds</strong>
            <p>To avoid wasteful vehicle trips, samples are distributed during scheduled weekend sample-delivery rounds alongside regular pre-orders.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#122815] block">Household Fair-Use Limits</strong>
            <p>Maximum 2 produce samples per household per delivery round. A 14-day re-order cooldown applies per mobile number to ensure fair access for all neighbours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#f0f5ee] flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#667a68]">
          <span>Zero product cost (₹0) on eligible approved samples</span>
          <span class="font-bold text-emerald-800">100% Raw • No Polishing</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <a href="/farm/samples" class="fd-btn fd-btn-accent w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 font-bold text-sm shadow-md">
          Request a Free Sample (100g/200g) &rarr;
        </a>
        <a href="/farm/products" class="fd-btn fd-btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3 font-bold text-sm">
          Browse Farm Produce Catalogue
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</FarmLayout>
